# =====================================================================
# Portable Git attributes.
# Normalize to LF in the repository; check out CRLF only for Windows-only
# scripts. Also assigns language-aware diff hunk headers, marks known
# binary formats, and lists dev metadata to exclude from `git archive`
# (shipped commented out; see the Archive export section).
# Anything not listed below falls back to `text=auto` content detection.
# =====================================================================

* text=auto eol=lf

